{"id":"zerrissen","lemma":"zerrissen","pos":"adj","rank":4462,"glosses":["torn, ripped (up)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e3/De-zerrissen.ogg/De-zerrissen.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"zerrissener","superlative":"am zerrissensten"},"examples":[{"text":"Ihr Kleid war zerrissen.","en":"Her dress was torn.","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"dress, gown"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Es war dein Kind, das mein Buch zerrissen hat.","en":"It was your child who tore my book to pieces.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"kid"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"book (collection of…"},null,{"g":"has","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Ich habe alle Briefe zerrissen, die du geschrieben hast.","en":"I've torn up all the letters you've written.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"letter","l":"Brief"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to write, to write out","l":"schreiben"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Mein Hosenboden ist zerrissen.","en":"The seat of my pants is torn.","words":[{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe alle Briefe, die du mir geschrieben hast, zerrissen.","en":"I tore up all the letters that you wrote to me.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"letter","l":"Brief"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"to write, to write out","l":"schreiben"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null]}]}